Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 06:10:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): hold claims during gateway drain; scope crash
 output to current run (#297)

* fix(kanban): hold claims during gateway drain and scope diagnostics to their run [daveey]

* fix(kanban): rebase drain admission onto restart-wait; marker-aware legacy refusal detection

* fix(kanban): logs predating the run marker keep their trailer/Session fallback
